Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:27:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 87/87] TEST: GH-5 S2R working set (patches/s2r-kernel
 0001-0007 in Aurora-DeepIdle)

PCIe port redo after the cut, NVMe/ANS cold start, PMP power cycle (Ante042's method),
RTKit longer IOP ack wait, ATC PHY restore and t6020 park_dummy_phy, i2c-pasemi resume,
macsmc-reboot test logs and knobs (REG_ON, bnap, pmVC, SMC key dump).
